# LUMO Inventory Management System - Project Overview

## Project Description
LUMO is a **comprehensive inventory management system** built with Next.js 15.3.1, Supabase PostgreSQL, and modern web technologies for scalable business operations.

## Architecture Stack

### Frontend
- **Framework**: Next.js 15.3.1 with App Router
- **Language**: TypeScript with strict type checking
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS with custom component system
- **UI Components**: Shadcn/UI and Radix UI primitives
- **State Management**: React Context + Supabase real-time

### Backend
- **Database**: Supabase PostgreSQL with Row Level Security
- **Authentication**: Hybrid Supabase Auth + Custom JWT
- **API**: Next.js API Routes with RESTful design
- **File Storage**: Supabase Storage for imports/exports

### Development Tools
- **Testing**: Jest (unit) + Playwright (e2e) + Integration tests
- **Code Quality**: ESLint + TypeScript + Prettier
- **Build**: Webpack with performance optimizations
- **Deployment**: Choreo platform with Docker containers

## Key Features

### Inventory Management
- **Products**: Full CRUD with categorization and locations
- **Stock Tracking**: Real-time inventory levels and movements
- **Sales Integration**: Transaction recording and margin analysis
- **Bulk Operations**: Import/export via Excel, bulk adjustments

### User Management
- **Role-Based Access**: ADMIN, USER roles with permissions
- **Authentication**: Secure login with session management
- **Single Root User**: `alesierraalta@gmail.com` per environment

### Business Intelligence
- **Reporting**: Low stock alerts, margin analysis
- **Performance Metrics**: Sales tracking and profitability
- **Data Export**: Excel reports and scheduled exports

